Package: corerealtime
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: CoreRealtime server (Linux x86_64)
 CoreRealtime is a clean-room implementation of the Photon Realtime server,
 targeting Linux x86_64 (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu).
 The goal of this project is to be a drop-in replacement for the official
 server for multiplayer games that utilize Photon.
 It aims to support games out of the box, provided they do not rely on complex
 server-side plugins.
